title: plague_doctor
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "The Plague Doctor">>
You come across a man in a doctor's garb, observing some carcasses.
He appears lost in thought, muttering to himself as he examines a collection of worn notes in his hands.
Doctor: "...Remarkable. The musculature is quite different from what I had expected..."
He lets out a delighted chuckle.
He doesn't seem to have noticed you yet.
-> Ask for a lecture #paneldetails=Gain_1_Potency._-15_Light
    <<change_potency 1>><<change_light -15>>
    You approach the doctor, intrigued by his observations.
    He launches into an impassioned lecture on demonic anatomy, comparing it to that of ordinary monsters..
    You listen intently. His knowledge is extraordinary, and his explanations are surprisingly enlightening.
    However... his rather graphic "enthusiasm" on the matter has left you... quite disturbed.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> Leave him to himself. 
    You decide it is better not to pry into his work.
